{"text": "鬼玩人—Evil Dead(版) - APP每日推送\n鬼玩人—Evil Dead（已下架）\n鬼玩人是根据80年代的恐怖电影《The Evil Dead》改编而成3D射击游戏，画面虽然有些暴力，但相比其他僵尸题材的游戏还算Q一些。电影讲述的是五个大学生一起相约到田纳西州的一片森林进行探险。在森林里探险的时候，他们找到了一间废弃的小屋，于是众人打算在里面度过周末。但是在这座废弃的小屋里隐藏着无比危险的东西——一盘录音带和一本死亡之书。当众人找到了录音带和那本书之后，隐藏在上面的恶魔的诅咒就被触发了⋯⋯众人将面对犹如地狱一般的惨剧。\nWordPress database error: [You have an error in your SQL syntax; check the manual that corresponds to your MySQL server version for the right syntax to use near ') AND p.ID != 2862 AND p.post_status = 'publish' AND p.post_type = 'post' GROUP ' at line 1]\nSELECT p.ID, p.post_title, p.post_content,count(tr.object_id) as cnt FROM wp_posts AS p INNER JOIN wp_term_relationships AS tr ON p.ID = tr.object_id INNER JOIN wp_term_taxonomy AS tt ON tt.term_taxonomy_id = tr.term_taxonomy_id INNER JOIN wp_postmeta AS pm ON p.ID = pm.post_id WHERE pm.meta_key = 'app_expired' AND pm.meta_value !='1' AND tt.term_id IN (,) AND p.ID != 2862 AND p.post_status = 'publish' AND p.post_type = 'post' GROUP BY tr.object_id ORDER BY cnt DESC,RAND() LIMIT 0, 8;"}
