{"text": "【艺术名家·陈艳梅】 - 华夏品牌 - 东北名网\n发表：2020-01-17 08:49:30 频道：华夏品牌\n居住北京，有个人艺术创作室；世界华人艺术家协会理事；中国民族文化研究院理事：中国民主建国会民建党员；中国美术家协会北京会员；北京正\n居住北京，有个人艺术创作室；世界华人艺术家协会理事；中国民族文化研究院理事：中国民主建国会民建党员；中国美术家协会北京会员；北京正德书画院画家。\nGraduate from China Central Academy of Fine Arts Chinese painting department in 1990; In May of 1992, she held her first solo exhibition in Beijing contemporary art museum.;In August of 1992 held another solo exhibition in Shenzhen Museum and her artworks are collected by the museum. In October 1997, she successfully held her personal exhibition in China National Art Museum.;In 1999 participated in the “art and peace year “ group art exhibition in the United Nations, and her exhibited works won the gold award;In 2000, participated in the group art exhibition during the World Expo in Paris as the delegation of Chinese artists which is organized by the ministry of culture, France and all the exhibited works are collected; From 2004 to 2006, she participated in the art exhibition of China art expo for three consecutive years and won three golden awards; In 2006, she participated in the art exhibition in Tokyo Art Museum and won the prize!; In 2007, she participated in the art exhibition for celebrating the35th diplomatic anniversary between China and Australia; In 2015, she participated in Salon de Art which is organized by French Artists Association and won the salon award; In 2016, she participated in Artexpo New York and exhibited artworks were published on the official art magazine, all works are collected by collectors；In 2019, she was invited to participate the 41th Artexpo New York and get the Award of Excellence.\n作品多次参加国内外大展、受到好评！作品被中国邮政印制邮票珍藏版！作品被美国邮政印制邮票珍藏册！作品入选世界名人录、新中国美术家大典！中国当代名人录、中华儿女、中华英才等！\nMrs Yan-mei Chen’s artworks have participated in many domestic and international exhibitions and received a lot of praise.The works have been printed by China post and the United States postal stamp collection .Her artworks are also selected into the world Famous Artists Record, New China artists Grand Book, Chinese contemporary Celebrity Record, Chinese Sons and Daughters, Chinese talents and so on!\n《古城秋韵》100×80cm 炳烯颜料\n《古战场》100×80cm 炳烯颜料\n《合家欢》100×80cm 炳烯颜料\n《农家乐》100×80cm 炳烯颜料\n《赛场》100×80cm 炳烯颜料\n《新年》100×80cm 炳烯颜料\n《雄风》100×80cm 炳烯颜料\n《迎战》100×80cm 炳烯颜料\n《悦》100×80cm 炳烯颜料\n《追风》100×80cm 炳烯颜料\n发表：2020-01-17 08:49:30\n定调2020：国家能源集团、华能、国家电网决定这么干......\n新希望刘永好自述：创业四十年\n马仿列：未来中国新能源汽车产业将是红海\n郭广昌：一个公式 四个维度 赢未来十年\n【艺术名家·吴刚】 【艺术简历】吴刚，字伯兆，号梦墨山人，1936年生于萍乡，1960年毕业于江西师范学院艺术系。师从著名画家燕鸣、彭友善...\n【艺术名家·陆云志】 【艺术简介】陆云志，1977年12月生，贵州省长顺县人。中国美术家协会会员，贵州省美术家协会会员。毕业于贵州省民族大...\n【艺术名家·曹梅】 【艺术简历】曹梅，南京人，汉族，毕业于南京艺术学院，本科，学士学位，别号金虹秀， 斋号悟墨轩，现定居北京。先后..."}
