{"text": "米兰：除了时装，我们还有自己的科创生态圈 今日华闻\n首页 / 教育职场 / 米兰：除了时装，我们还有自己的科创生态圈\n2017-10-27 19:00:00 文 Helen 编辑 林卉卉 3650 0\n本文为《华闻周刊》原创文章，未经授权，请勿授权。\n内容合作，发送电邮至：editor@thechineseweekly.com。\n5 英镑波动明显，“脱欧”进程主导外汇走势\n8 牛剑也戴“有色眼镜”？半数学生来自英国八所顶尖私校\n9 德阿蒙特: 推广卢森堡是我的工作，更是我的热情所在\n10 俄媒：明年起汉语将加入“俄罗斯高考”\n请求信息 : 2018-12-12 10:12:17 HTTP/1.0 GET : /index.php?g=&m=article&a=index&id=49053\n运行时间 : 0.2093s ( Load:0.0168s Init:0.0030s Exec:0.0325s Template:0.1569s )\n内存开销 : 3,846.32 kb\n会话信息 : SESSION_ID=mkdtlcbqkesnup529jnfqdhmu6\n[ template_filter ] --END-- [ RunTime:-0.019414s ]\nRun Behavior\\ParseTemplateBehavior [ RunTime:0.029879s ]\n[ view_parse ] --END-- [ RunTime:0.029910s ]\nRun Behavior\\ParseTemplateBehavior [ RunTime:0.124119s ]\n[ view_filter ] --END-- [ RunTime:-0.093955s ]\nSELECT a.*,a.id as post_id,c.user_login,c.user_nicename,b.term_id,t.name,t.sublabel,t.icon FROM hw_posts a INNER JOIN hw_term_relationships b ON a.id = b.object_id INNER JOIN hw_terms t ON t.term_id = b.term_id INNER JOIN hw_users c ON a.user_id = c.id WHERE a.id = 49053 LIMIT 1 [ RunTime:0.0009s ]\nUPDATE `hw_posts` SET `post_hits`=post_hits+1 WHERE `id` = 49053 [ RunTime:0.0002s ]\nSELECT * FROM hw_term_relationships a INNER JOIN hw_posts as b on a.object_id =b.id INNER JOIN hw_users as c on b.user_id = c.id WHERE b.id > 49053 AND `post_date` >= '2017-10-27 19:00:00' AND a.status = 1 AND a.term_id = 74 AND `post_status` = 1 ORDER BY post_date asc,b.id asc LIMIT 1 [ RunTime:0.0030s ]\nSELECT * FROM hw_term_relationships a INNER JOIN hw_posts as b on a.object_id =b.id INNER JOIN hw_users as c on b.user_id = c.id WHERE b.id < 49053 AND `post_date` <= '2017-10-27 19:00:00' AND a.status = 1 AND a.term_id = 74 AND `post_status` = 1 ORDER BY post_date desc,b.id desc LIMIT 1 [ RunTime:0.0126s ]\nSELECT * FROM `hw_comments` WHERE `post_table` = 'posts' AND `post_id` = 49053 AND `status` = 1 ORDER BY createtime DESC [ RunTime:0.0003s ]\nSELECT `post_title`,`post_excerpt`,`object_id`,terms.term_id,`smeta`,(UNIX_TIMESTAMP(NOW())-UNIX_TIMESTAMP(posts.post_date)) as period,terms.name as term_name FROM hw_term_relationships term_relationships right JOIN hw_posts as posts on term_relationships.object_id = posts.id left JOIN hw_terms as terms on term_relationships.term_id = terms.term_id left JOIN hw_users as users on posts.user_id = users.id left JOIN hw_posts_author posts_author on posts.author_id = posts_author.id WHERE term_relationships.status = 1 AND posts.post_status = 1 AND ( posts.post_date>'2018-11-14' and ( post_content like '%科创%' or post_content like '%意大利%' or post_content like '%米兰%' or terms.term_id='74') ) GROUP BY posts.id ORDER BY post_hits desc LIMIT 0,10 [ RunTime:0.0850s ]"}
