{"text": "北方基因代理商仍宣传食品有功效 挂靠后称合法_直销报道网-行业新闻门户网站\nWUBINGXIN\u0005\u0007\u0005\u0006\b\u0005，ZHEWEIJINAN\u0005\u0007\u0005\u0006\b\u0005、SHANDONGNAIZHIQUANGUOCENGJINGJIAYUHUXIAO\u0005\u0007\u0005\u0006\b\u0005DERENWU\u0005\u0007\u0005\u0006\b\u0005，YIJING“CHENJI”LEHENDUONIAN\u0005\u0007\u0005\u0006\b\u0005。XUDUO\n大家乐彩票开户“DANGQIAN\b\u0005\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005，HUOCHEJINRUGAOTIESHIDAI;JIQIJINRU5GSHIDAI;ZUOWEIJIANKANGCHANYE\b\u0005\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005DEYIYUAN\b\u0005\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005，WANMEIGONGSIYEYAOZHUIDESHANG\nGANGBIMU\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007DEZHONGYANGJINGJIGONGZUOHUIYIZHICHU\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007，2020NIANZHENGCEJIANGJINKOUQUANMIANJIANCHENGXIAOKANGSHEHUIMUBIAORENWU\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007，JIANCHIWEN\n北方基因代理商仍宣傳食品有功效 掛靠后稱合法\n時間:2019-12-27 11:27來源:反傳防騙聯盟 作者:反傳防騙聯盟 點擊: 次\n近年來小分子肽產品非常火爆\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007，在好多商家銷售人員口中小分子肽被說種“救命仙丹”一樣\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007的神品\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007，什么癌癥也能治好\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007、尿毒癥也能治好\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007、白血病也能治好等等\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007。在諸多小分子肽產品中\n【直報網北京2019年12月27日訊】(反傳防騙聯盟)近年來小分子肽產品非常火爆，在好多商家銷售人員口中小分子肽被說種“救命仙丹”一樣的神品，什么癌癥也能治好、尿毒癥也能治好、白血病也能治好等等。在諸多小分子肽產品中，有家名為 北京北方基因生物科技有限公司(以下簡稱：北方基因)代理商就大肆宣傳北方基因小分子肽可以治療各種疾病。除此之外，發展兩個人一碰就能回本，年入百萬不是問題。那么，北方基因究竟是什么呢?我們一探究竟。\nQUNIAN12YUE27RI\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，ZHONGGUOZHILIANGXINWENWANGBAODAOLE《BEIFANGJIYINJINGXIAOSHANGXUANCHENGXIAOFENZITAINENGZHIDUOZHONGJIBING》YIWENBEISHOUXIAOFEIZHEGUANZHU\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，GAIXINWENZHONGPILULEBEIFANGJIYINGAOJIHEXINDAILISHANGZAIQUNLIFABUBEIFANGJIYINXIAOFENZITAIZHILIAOAIZHENGDENGYINANZAZHENG\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\bDEANLIYUSHIPIN\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，BINGXUANCHENGYUZHONGGUOWEIYIDENUOBEIERYIXUEJIANG(TUYOUYOU)TUANDUIHEZUO\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，KAIZHANSHIGEKEYANKETI\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b。\nJINGUANBEIFANGJIYINDUICIZAIGUANWANGFABULE《SHENGMING》CHENG\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005，BEIFANGJIYINXIAOFENZITAIZHI\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005SHIPUTONGSHIPIN\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005，DAN\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005SHIBEIJINGJIYIN\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005DEDAILISHANGMENBINGBUZHEMERENWEI\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005，JUZHONGGUOZHILIANGWANLIXINGBAODAO\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005，BUSHAODAILISHANGTONGGUOSHEJIAORUANJIANFABUBEIFANGJIYINXIAOFENZIHUOXINGTAI\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005DEGONGXIAOZHUYAOYOUSHIZHONG：ZHUBUJIANGDIXUEYA\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005，RUANHUAXUEGUANXINNAOXUEGUANBING;RONGSHUAN\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005、HUIFUSHENJINGXITONGGONGNENG;YUFANGTANGNIAOBINGJIBINGFAZHENG;KANGZHONGLIU\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005、YANCHISHOUMING;HUANJIEGUANJIEYAN\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005、YAOTUITENGTONG;BAINEIZHANG\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005、QINGGUANGYAN\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005、LAOHUAYAN\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005、JINSHIJUNYOUXIAO;YANGWEIQINGCHANG\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005，XIAOCHUGELEICHANGWEIJIBING;QUBANKANGZHOU\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005、MEIBAINENFU;QIANGSHENGUBEN\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005、XIUFULUANCHAO\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005，XIAOCHUYAJIANKANG;SHIMIANYIYU\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005、SHENJINGXITONGJIBINGYOUWANGYIQUBUFUFAN\b\b\u0005\u0006\u0005。\n北方基因肽宣傳可調理糖尿病、高血壓、高血脂\nSHENZHE\u0005\u0006\b\u0006\b\u0005，ZHONGGUOZHILIANGXINWENWANGZAIBEIFANGJIYIN“QIYEZIXUN”YILANZHONGFAXIAN\u0005\u0006\b\u0006\b\u0005，BEIFANGJIYINFABU\u0005\u0006\b\u0006\b\u0005DEDALIANGZIXUNSHEJIXINNAOXUEGUANJIBING\u0005\u0006\b\u0006\b\u0005、AIZHENG\u0005\u0006\b\u0006\b\u0005、KANGSHUAILAODENGANSHICHANPINGONGXIAO\u0005\u0006\b\u0006\b\u0005DENEIRONG\u0005\u0006\b\u0006\b\u0005。\n大家乐彩票开户 WEILEYANZHENGBEIFANGJIYINTAINENGGOUZHIBING\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，QUNIAN12YUE17RI\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，BEIFANGJIYINGUANWANGHUANFABULE《BEIFANGJIYINYUZHONGGUOZHONGYIKEXUEYUANZHONGYAOYANJIUSUOKEYANKETI》YIWEN\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，BEIJINGBEIFANGJIYINSHENGWUKEJIYOUXIANGONGSIJIESHAOQIYUZHONGGUOZHONGYIKEXUEYUANZHONGYAOYANJIUSUOJINXINGKETISHIYAN\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，JIU\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\bSHIZAIGAOZHIGONGZHONG\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，BEIFANGJIYINDADOUXIAOFENZITAIJUYOUMINGXIAN\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\bDESHENGWUXUEGONGNENGJI：DIAOJIEMIANYI\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\b、KANGPILAO\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\b、KANGYANGHUA\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\b、DIAOJIEXUEYA\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\b。DAN\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\bSHIHENKUAI\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，BEIFANGJIYINGUANWANGYUGONGZHONGHAOGUANYUZHONGYIKEXUEYUANZHONGYAOYANJIUSUO\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\bDESHIYANBAOGAO\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\bDEXINWENYUTUPIANDOUYIJINGCHEDIAO\b\u0005\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\u0006\b。\n大家乐彩票开户 GENJU《ZHONGHUARENMINGONGHEGUOGUANGGAOFA》DISITIAOGUIDING：“GUANGGAOBUDEHANYOUXUJIA\u0005\b\u0006\u0007DENEIRONG\u0005\b\u0006\u0007，BUDEQIPIANHEWUDAOXIAOFEIZHE\u0005\b\u0006\u0007。”DISHIJIUTIAOGUIDING：“SHIPIN\u0005\b\u0006\u0007、JIULEI\u0005\b\u0006\u0007、HUAZHUANGPINGUANGGAONEIRONGBIXUFUHEWEISHENGXUKE\u0005\b\u0006\u0007DESHIXIANG\u0005\b\u0006\u0007，BINGBUDESHIYONGYILIAOYONGYUHUOZHEYUYAOPINHUNXIAO\u0005\b\u0006\u0007DEYONGYU\u0005\b\u0006\u0007。”《SHIPINBIAOSHIGUANLIGUIDING》DISHIBATIAOGUIDING：SHIPINBIAOSHIBUDEBIAOZHUXIALIENEIRONG：(YI)MINGSHIHUOZHEANSHIJUYOUYUFANG\u0005\b\u0006\u0007、ZHILIAOJIBINGZUOYONG\u0005\b\u0006\u0007DE;(ER)FEIBAOJIANSHIPINMINGSHIHUOZHEANSHIJUYOUBAOJIANZUOYONG\u0005\b\u0006\u0007DE\u0005\b\u0006\u0007。\n大家乐彩票开户 FANCHUANFANGPIANLIANMENGHUANFAXIAN\b\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\b\u0005\u0007，RENGYOUBUSHAODAILISHANGDASIXUANCHUANBEIFANGJIYINTAIKEYIZHILIAOAIZHENG\b\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\b\u0005\u0007DECHENGGONGANLI\b\u0006\u0007\u0005\u0006\b\u0005\u0007。\nJUZHONGGUOZHILIANGXINWENWANGBAODAO\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007，ZHIYAOJIAONA590YUANGOUMAIYIHECHANPINJIUKEYICHENGWEICHUJIDAILI\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007，ZAIJIA100YUANJIUKEYICHENGWEIZHONGSHENDAILI;ZHIYAOJIAONA3640YUAN(6HECHANPIN)JIUKEYICHENGWEIZHONGJIDAILI;JIAONA10720YUAN(18HECHANPIN)JIUKEYICHENGWEIGAOJIDAILI\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007。\nERJUBEIFANGJIYINDAILISHANGFANYING：“BEIFANGJIYINZHITUILIANGGEJIUHUIBEN\b\u0005\u0006\b\u0005，JIEJUEXIANSHIWENTI\b\u0005\u0006\b\u0005，XIAOQU