{"text": "﻿ 12日猪评：母猪产能决定生猪供应，供应紧张格局将延续 - 通化资讯网\n2020-01-15 投稿人 : sygthx.com 围观 : 1614 次\n3D之家预测BUFENDIQUSHICHANGSHOUROUXINGZHUJIAGE(DANWEI:RENMINBI/JIN)\nHEILONGJIANGSHENGZHUJIAGE9.6\nJILINSHENGZHUJIAGE9.7\nLIAONINGSHENGZHUJIAGE9.8\nHEBEISHENGZHUJIAGE9.8\nHENANSHENGZHUJIAGE9.9\nSHANDONGSHENGZHUJIAGE9.8\nSHANXISHENGZHUJIAGE9.9\nSHANXISHENGZHUJIAGE9.7\nGANSUSHENGZHUJIAGE9.8\nJIANGXISHENGZHUJIAGE10.4\nJIANGSUSHENGZHUJIAGE10.0\nHUBEISHENGZHUJIAGE9.9\nHUNANSHENGZHUJIAGE10.2\nSHANGHAISHENGZHUJIAGE10.3\nFUJIANSHENGZHUJIAGE10.0\n3D之家预测GUANGDONGSHENGZHU SHENGZHUJIAGE10.0\nSICHUANSHENGZHUJIAGE9.8\n3D之家预测GUANDIAN:JINTIANQUANGUOSHENGZHUPINGJUNJIAGEWEI19.34YUAN/GONGJIN\u0006\b\u0006\u0005，BIZUOTIANSHANGZHANG0.11YUAN/GONGJIN\u0006\b\u0006\u0005，SHOUROUXINGSHENGZHUPINGJUNJIAGEWEI19.77YUAN/GONGJIN\u0006\b\u0006\u0005，BIZUOTIANSHANGZHANG0.05YUAN/GONGJIN\u0006\b\u0006\u0005。\nQUANGUOSHOUROUXINGZHU\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005DEPINGJUNJIAGELVEYOUSHANGZHANG\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005。BEIFANGSHENGZHU\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005DEZHENGTIGAOJIAZHUYAO\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005SHIYOUZHENGHEJUEDING\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005DE\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005，BODONGHENXIAO\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005。HEILONGJIANG\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005、LIAONING\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005、HENAN\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005、SHANDONGHEGANSUSHENGZHUJIAGEWENDING\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005，JILINHEHEBEIXIAJIANG0.1YUAN/GONGJIN\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005，SHANXISHANGSHENG0.1YUAN/GONGJIN\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005，SHANXISHANGSHENG0.2YUAN/GONGJIN\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005。NANFANG\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005DESHENGZHUJIAGEXIYOUCANBAN\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005，JIANGXISHANGZHANG0.3YUAN/GONGJIN\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005，HUNANXIADIE0.6YUAN/GONGJIN\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005，GUANGDONGXIADIE0.3YUAN/GONGJIN\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005。JINTIAN\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005，SUOYOUSHOUROUXINGZHU\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005DEPINGJUNJIAGEZAIJIANGSUZUIGAO\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005，PINGJUNJIAGEWEI20.04YUAN/GONGJIN\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005，HEILONGJIANGZUIDI\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005，QUANSHENGPINGJUNJIAGEWEI19.1YUAN/GONGJIN\b\u0006\b\u0006\u0007\u0005。\n3D之家预测SHENGZHUJIAGEJUGAOBUXIA\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，BUFENZHUROUXIAOFEIBEIQITAROULEITIDAI\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，SHICHANGXUQIUPIRUAN\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，TUZAIQIYEMIANLINXIAOSHOUYALI\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，DANSHICHANGSHENGZHULAIYUANJINZHANG\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，NONGMINBUYUANCHUSHOU\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，TUZAIQIYEDUIJIANGJIAMEIYOUMINGXIANYINGXIANG\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，ZAIGONGXUBOYIXIA\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，SHENGZHUJIAGEZHUYAOWENBUDIAOZHENG\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b。LIAONINGDALIANZUORIKAISHIYIMEIGONGJIN11YUAN4 ~ 5YUAN\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\bDEJIAGEXIANGSHICHANGTOUFANG1000DUNSHIJICHUBEIROU\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，DIYUTONGDENGJIXIANROU\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\bDESHICHANGJIAGE\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b。RANER\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，DUIGUONEISHENGZHUJIAGE\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\bDEYINGXIANGYOUXIAN\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，HENNANGAIBIANSHENGZHUSHICHANGGONGYINGJINZHANG\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\bDESHISHI\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b。\nZHANWANGWEILAI\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，YOUYUMUZHUSHENGCHANNENGLI\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\bDEHUIFU\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，GUONEIZHU\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\bDEGONGBUYINGQIUJIANGHUIJIXU\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，ZHEIZHONGQINGKUANGHENNANBEIRENHEYIZHONGJIANGUANZHENGCEGAIBIAN\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b。YINCI\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，GONGYINGJINZHANGDUISHENGZHUJIAGEYOUHENQIANG\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\bDEZHICHENG\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，SHENGZHUJIAGEXIADIAO\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\bDEKONGJIANYOUXIAN\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b。YUJI4YUEFENGUONEISHENGZHUJIAGEJIANGJIXUZOUGAO\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b。NONGYEBUBUZHANGHANZHANGBINZAIZUOTIAN\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\bDE“SHISANWU”XILIEBAOGAOZHONGBIAOSHI\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，“XIAYIBU\b\u0005\u0006\u0005\u0006\u0006\b，WOME