{"text": "消防维保工程消防应急灯闪烁的原因|消防资讯|江苏省钟星消防工程有限公司无锡锡山分公司\n当前位置： 首页 > 新闻动态 > 公司动态 消防维保工程消防应急灯闪烁的原因\n来源：钟星消防无锡锡山分公司 时间：2018-06-11 点击量：\n消防维保提醒：\n分析原因一：\n消防应急灯出现灯光闪烁的现象，可能是因为应急灯具的电路与电子元件在焊接的过程中，电子元件的插脚不够洁净，插脚的表面或者有氧化的现象存在，焊接之后的电路部分处于一种虚焊的可能；以后在使用的过程中受到外力的影响\n如：冲击、震动等因素），消防应急灯在正常接通市电的情况下，电路处于一种半接触，半离合的状态，从而造成灯光的闪烁；\n分析原因二：\n消防应急灯的送达一般是要经过长途的运输，其中汽车货运是主要的运输方式；（注：消防应急灯是不能够进行空运的，因为灯具里面配置有电池，虽然电池在灯具的使用之前是处于一种放空的状态，但是目前空运是不接受消防应急灯的托运业务的）；\n汽车运输的过程中，难免会经历剧烈的颠簸，强烈的震动等情况，造成应急灯具的电路某些元件连接的松动现象，使用的过程中出现电路的接触不良，从而出现灯光的闪烁现象；当然这类现象发生的几率很小，用户在使用时，发现应急灯具出现这种现象，可以直接联系经销商，要求更换或返回免费维修。\nFire protection reminding:\nAnalysis of reasons 1:\nThe phenomenon of flashing lights flashing in the fire emergency lights may be because the pins of the electronic components are not clean enough, the surface of the pins are not clean, the surface of the pins are in the presence of oxidation, and the circuit part after the welding is in a kind of virtual welding. Influence of force\nSuch as: shock, vibration and other factors), the fire emergency lights in the normal access to the city electricity, the circuit is in a semi - contact, half - off state, resulting in the flashing lights;\nAnalysis of reasons two:\nThe delivery of fire emergency lights is usually transported by long distance, in which the automobile freight is the main mode of transportation; (Note: fire emergency lights are not able to be transported by air, because the lamps are equipped with batteries, although the battery is in a state of release before the use of the lamps and lanterns, but the air transport is not accepted at present. \" The consignment service of the emergency lights;\nIn the course of automobile transportation, it is unavoidable to experience severe turbulence, strong vibration and so on, which causes the loosening of some components connected to the circuit of emergency lamps and lanterns, and the contact of the circuit is bad in the process of use, thus the light flicker appears; of course, the probability of this kind of phenomenon is very small and the user is in use, It is found that the phenomenon of emergency luminaries can be directly related to distributors, requiring replacement or return to free maintenance.\n上一页：对二氧化碳灭火器如何进行维护保养\n下一页：四层及四层以上楼层的消防监督管理"}
